{"id": 5028, "jp_tail": "げないと駄目よ」", "zh": "【护士】「他呀，你可要好好珍惜才行哦」", "score": 88, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 5029, "jp_tail": "乃】「……はい」", "zh": "【雪乃】「……是」", "score": 88, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
