{"id": 5088, "jp_tail": "【雪乃】「はい」", "zh": "【雪乃】「是」", "score": 88, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 5089, "jp_tail": "う決まってる？」", "zh": "【由加里】「难道说已经定好了？」", "score": 88, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
